	(text "Vout = 0.6V x (1 + 100k/5.1k) = 12.36V. L = 4.7uH, D4 = SS34 (datasheet application). EN pulled down 100k -> off with a blank MCU.\nA boost passes VIN to its output when stopped, so Q1 (AO3401A, Vgs max +-12V) cuts the output. Q2 and Q3 in series pull the gate down\nthrough 100k only when SW12_ON is high AND +3.3V is present: Vgs = -12.36 x 100k/200k = -6.2V (-9.8V if VIN = 20V).\nC32 47nF drain-gate slows the edge to about 1.3 V/ms. Q2 gate pulled down 100k -> off with a blank MCU.\nF1 (PTC 0.75A hold) protects against a short on the card. R18 bleeds the +12V line to 0V when off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.5 147.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "002a3e1e-c59d-5fe5-ad45-360fa912b08f")
	)
	(text "Vout = 0.8V x (1 + 47k/15k) = 3.307V. RT open = 500kHz. L = 4.7uH (datasheet table 10-2). SS 100nF -> tSS = 100n x 0.8 / 5.5u = 14.5ms.\nEN = VBUS1 x 68k/(100k+68k) = 0.405 x VBUS1: turns on at VBUS1 > 3.0V typ (3.16V max), EN = 2.0V @5V, 3.6V @9V, 5.5V @13.6V.\nD5 clamps EN to +5V + Vf (< 6V abs max) if VBUS1 ever goes higher. MCU (PC3, open drain) can pull EN low. C15 1uF: EN rises in about 37ms.\nCharger on J2 alone -> VBUS1 = 0 -> EN low -> 3.3V stays off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.5 147.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1dd9ceaa-f7d7-5819-b15d-1907c0a28cc4")
	)
	(text "Mechanical"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 506.5 257.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2d61cd2d-fd90-5400-80c8-b34a81674d51")
	)
	(text "Same circuit as (1). D+/D- of J2 are not connected. Shield of J2 goes straight to GND.\nD2 blocks back-feed from VIN to the charger port; D1/D2 together pick the higher input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 211.5 25.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "43a5c423-e8f3-58a2-a06d-7295b5a13768")
	)
	(text "CH224A: Rset 6.8k on CFG1 = 9V (datasheet table 5-1). VHV and VBUS pins tied to the connector VBUS, 1uF on VHV.\nCC1/CC2 go straight to U1 (Rd is inside U1). DP/DM of U1 are not used (data goes to J4 only).\nCFG2/CFG3 = I2C (0x22/0x23, address not selectable) -> own bus per chip. PG is not used (state is read over I2C).\nD1 blocks back-feed from VIN to the PC. Shield: 1M || 100nF to GND.\nR28 || R29 = 1k bleeder: pulls VBUS1 below 0.8V against the reverse leakage of D1 when only J2 is powered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.5 25.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "46ac9826-7d88-5dee-9dfb-627c5feca091")
	)
	(text "USB 2.0 data: J1 -> U5 (ESD) -> J4"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 476.5 143.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5b277610-aa49-5176-b5c4-4ec9a6a581dc")
	)
	(text "Pin names follow the PCIe CEM pinout (side B = component side of the card, side A = solder side).\n+12V: A2 A3 B1 B2 B3.  +3.3V: A9 A10 B8.  3.3Vaux: B10 via JP4 (solder jumper, closed).\nGND: A4 A12 A15 A18 B4 B7 B13 B16 B18.  PERST# (A11): 15k to +3.3V, 10uF to GND -> 2.0V about 140ms after 3.3V. D6 empties C31 when 3.3V drops.\nPRSNT#, WAKE#, JTAG, SMBus, REFCLK and the lane pins are left open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 306.5 261.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6006dbb1-2155-5150-9a73-78bcf333e1ac")
	)
	(text "U4: 12V / 0.5A boost (MT3608B)  +  Q1/Q2 output switch  +  JP2 (current measurement)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.5 143.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "626079b0-96c7-58df-b5d7-7a74f3474e97")
	)
	(text "SRV05-4: 1=IO1 2=GND 3=IO2 4=IO3 5=REF 6=IO4.\nD+ on IO1, D- on IO2 (one diode pair per line).\nIO3, IO4 not used.\nREF is left open: its TVS breaks down at 6V,\nVBUS1 can be 9V.\nJ4 = motherboard USB 2.0 header pinout:\n1 VBUS, 3 D-, 5 D+, 7 GND, 9 key (pull the pin).\nJP3 (solder jumper, closed) feeds +5V to J4 pin 1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 476.5 147.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "716dd1cd-0857-5aea-b5d0-aae228e16aea")
	)
	(text "VDD = +5V (4.2 .. 5V). ADC reference = VDD, so firmware corrects with the internal Vref channel.\nCC1/CC2: 100k series + 100nF (the 100k keeps the load off the PD line; fault current into the pin < 0.2mA).\nVIN / VBUS1 sense = x 33k/(100k+33k) = 0.248: 5V -> 1.24V, 9V -> 2.23V, 20V (TVS clamp) -> 4.96V  (below VDD = 5V whenever VIN > 5.5V).\nPC3 = EN_3V3 and PC4 = PERST# (drive low or leave Hi-Z, never push-pull high). PD2 = EN_12V, PD3 = SW12_ON (100k pull-downs).\nPA2/A0 = +12V sense (x 0.248: 12.36V -> 3.07V).\nI2C1 (PC1/PC2) -> U1. Remap I2C1 to PC5/PC6 (AFIO I2C1_RM = 10b) -> U2. No external pull-ups: CH224A has them inside.\nJ5: 1 = SWIO, 2 = GND (WCH-LinkE). SW1: closed to GND = manual 12V override."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.5 261.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8c52a439-87dd-592a-8a84-b72c6773f228")
	)
	(text "J3: PCI Express x1 slot - power pins only"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 306.5 257.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a9a4cf9a-17d8-5f19-a40d-08a365f73ea1")
	)
	(text "HT7550-1: 1=GND 2=VIN(tab) 3=VOUT. 10uF in / 10uF out\n(datasheet application circuit).\nAt VIN=5V the output follows VIN minus dropout\n(about 4.2 .. 4.9V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 491.5 25.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ad23ebdf-e58f-5cb1-86d2-321eda4b009f")
	)
	(text "VIN bus (4.2 .. 9V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 401.5 21.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ae0566c0-2d23-5171-94f7-ce4e61eb1218")
	)
	(text "No TVS: every part on VIN is rated 25V or more\n(U3 30V, U4 24V, U6 30V, capacitors 25V),\nso a 20V charger fault does not break anything.\nBulk capacitors sit behind D1/D2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 401.5 25.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b4e269de-8513-525b-b74c-8b4de5989747")
	)
	(text "U3: 3.3V / 3A buck (TPS62933)  +  EN from J1 VBUS  +  JP1 (current measurement)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.5 143.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bd0982bd-4f0c-5d38-be10-d5783b3ab77e")
	)
